---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Work — Paul Ann Media"
  description="What we have built, and what we are building now."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-20">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold">Work</h1>
    <p class="mt-5 text-lg text-slate">
      We build for clients and we build for ourselves. The second part matters — running our
      own products is what keeps us honest about what actually works.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-14 space-y-8">
      <a href="https://hometimejobs.com"
         class="block rounded-lg border border-navy/10 bg-white p-8 hover:border-teal transition-colors">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-teal">Owned product</p>
        <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold">HomeTimeJobs</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate">
          A CDL driver platform built on a simple observation: every job board leads with cents
          per mile, but drivers leave carriers over home time. We built it the other way around —
          schedule first, then pay, then everything else.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-slate">
          Static Astro build, FAQ and Organization schema throughout, llms.txt and crawler
          configuration so AI models can cite it. Driver audience on one side, carrier pipeline
          on the other.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-teal">hometimejobs.com &rarr;</p>
      </a>

      <div class="rounded-lg border border-navy/10 bg-white p-8">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate">In development</p>
        <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold">Paul Ann Labs</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate">
          Our sister company, and the place where marketing hands off to operations. Labs deploys
          AI inside the business itself — the systems that run payroll, safety, dispatch, and
          everything else that never shows up in a campaign report.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Client work</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-slate">
        We are selective early on purpose. If you would like to talk about a project, the fastest
        path is an email describing what you are trying to grow.
      </p>
      <a href="mailto:hello@paulannmedia.com"
         class="mt-6 inline-block rounded bg-teal px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-navy hover:bg-teal-light transition-colors">
        hello@paulannmedia.com
      </a>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
